{
  "uid": "bonanza-services",
  "title": "Bonanza · Servicios",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": [
    "bonanza"
  ],
  "timezone": "America/Guayaquil",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Servicios configurados disponibles",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "bonanza_service_available",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Duración del último sondeo",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "bonanza_service_duration_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Consultas por servicio y estado",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(service,status)(bonanza_lookup_tasks)",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Errores de descarga de artefactos",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(route,status)(rate(bonanza_http_requests_total{route=~\".*download.*|.*media.*|.*export.*\",status=~\"[45]..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Red del host (exportador opcional)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(device)(rate(node_network_receive_bytes_total{device!=\"lo\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "I/O de disco (exportador opcional)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by(device)(rate(node_disk_written_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Procesos del host (exportador opcional)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_procs_running",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Arranque del host (exportador opcional)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bonanza-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_boot_time_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}{{status}}{{priority}}{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "dateTimeAsIso"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Alcance de las mediciones",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "MinIO y APIs: configure MONITOR_SERVICE_PROBES y ejecute sample_monitoring cada minuto. Sin sondeos aparece Sin datos, no un estado saludable inventado. Colas representan registros reales de consultas de personas y placas. node_exporter es opcional y privado; para reinicios de servicios systemd habilite explícitamente su colector systemd. Los fallos de artefactos observados cubren respuestas HTTP de rutas de descarga/exportación, no todos los errores de negocio."
      }
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
